      "date": "2026-01-31T20:53:29.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.30 (down from ₹1.00 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.22b (up 25% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹40.3m (down 70% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.3% (down from 14% in 3Q 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 12%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 69%. Revenue is forecast to grow 14% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 23% growth forecast for the Consumer Services industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 35% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 38% per year.",
